("p", "Four claims constitute the new physics, and the first is the headline. Record phase transitions (Theorem IV): the Born records of monitored quantum circuits carry a phase structure — a ladder of non-analytic points of the replica free energies, at p<sub>c</sub><super>(2)</super> = 0.233810 and its higher-replica successors — at which the record statistics’ second-order response concentrates with the same inverse-gap signature that metabolic regulation shows at active-set boundaries. The physics is new on two axes at once: no phase structure in measurement records of monitored circuits is established anywhere in the literature the corpus surveyed, and the quantitative identity of the two response laws — a classical LP substrate and a quantum replica substrate — is a unification claim that only the corpus’s two halves together could even state. It is also certifiable physics: the boundaries are computed by an exact closure whose anchors reproduce to 10<super>−14</super>, so the prediction can be checked without new theory, on production runs the corpus already maintains, and the v23 L = 8 rung currently computing is the natural first scan."),
("p", "Second, obstruction as a physical observable (Theorem V): the intercept dimension, previously a negative theorem, becomes a measurable quantity with an exact calibration — the obstruction index, quantized by dimension combinatorics (4/3 at n = 2r+3, at the qutrit, at the classical boundary), with an operational readout in discrimination success and a hardware protocol attached. Third, the one-wall hypothesis (Law 3’s core): the combinatorial wall and the analytic wall are two faces of one compactness phenomenon. The evidence is structural: the Eckart–Young–Mirsky and AAK floors are compactness statements about the approximant family; weak König’s lemma is the failure of uniform compact search; the Borsuk–Ulam bound converts compactness into a diameter floor; the Weihrauch spectrum — with the halting-stage game’s obstruction sitting exactly at the PA degrees, and recursive capability complete for Σ<super>3</super> — grades the search costs. The reading this suggests for the halting-physics corpus is the genuinely new sentence: the physics of halting is the thermodynamics of compact search, with the PA-degree spectrum playing the role of a temperature scale. Fourth, the curvature–regulation correspondence as cross-domain physics: one quantitative law — second-order concentration at the non-analytic set, magnitude inverse to the gap — now instantiated on metabolic networks, monitored circuits, and governance delay dynamics, with the artefact discriminator as its practical test."),
